PODFoam: optional analysis_func and mesh_func hooks

A python_module.py may define two more functions. mesh_func runs once
before the first step with copies of the cell centres, volumes, solution
directions and cell polygons: a face on the first empty patch for each
cell that has one, or, with no empty patch, a plane slice of each cut
cell. analysis_func runs after every step with the time index, snapshot
count, residuals, Courant and continuity numbers and copies of U and p.
They change neither U nor p; with analysis_func the POD step collects a
snapshot at every step. Only the master rank calls them; see HOOKS.md.

